#org @DEX_ENTRY_MALAMAR
It wields the most compelling hypnotic\npowers of any POK\eMON, and it forces\nothers to do anything.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BINACLE
Two Binacle live together on one rock.\nWhen they fight, one of them will move\nto a different rock.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BARBARACLE
When they evolve, two Binacle multiply\ninto seven. They fight with the power\nof seven Binacle.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SKRELP
It looks just like rotten kelp. It\nhides from foes while storing up power\nfor its evolution.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DRAGALGE
