#org @DEX_ENTRY_DEDENNE
Its upper whiskers are sensors that\nsurvey its surroundings. Its lower\nwhiskers shoot electricity.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CARBINK
Born from temperatures and pressures\ndeep underground, it fires beams from\nthe stone in its head.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GOOMY
It's covered in a slimy membrane that\nmakes any punches or kicks slide off it\nharmlessly.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SLIGGOO
