#org @DEX_ENTRY_PHANTUMP
It is created when a spirit possesses\nrotten tree stumps. It prefers to live\nin abandoned forests.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TREVENANT
It can control trees at will. It will\ntrap people who harm the forest, so they\ncan never leave.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PUMPKABOO
