#org @DEX_ENTRY_HOOPA
It gathers things it likes and passes\nthem through its loop to teleport them\nto a secret place.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_VOLCANION
It expels its internal steam from the\narms on its back. It has enough power to\nblow away a mountain.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ROWLET
