#org @DEX_ENTRY_TAPU_FINI
The guardian deity of Poni can control\nwater. It can create pure water that\nwill wash away any impurity.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_COSMOG
Its body is gaseous and frail. It\nslowly grows as it collects dust from\nthe atmosphere.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_COSMOEM
As it absorbs light, Cosmoem continues\nto grow. Its golden shell is\nsurprisingly solid.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SOLGALEO
In writings from the distant past, it's\ncalled by the name 'the beast that\ndevours the sun.'.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_LUNALA
It sometimes summons unknown powers and\nlife-forms to this world from holes\nthat lead to other worlds.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NIHILEGO
A life-form from another world, it was\ndubbed a UB and is thought to produce a\nstrong neurotoxin.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BUZZWOLE
Buzzwole goes around showing off its\nabnormally swollen muscles. It is one\nkind of Ultra Beast.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PHEROMOSA
One of the dangerous Ultra Beasts, it\nhas been spotted running across the land\nat terrific speeds.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_XURKITREE
It appeared from the Ultra Wormhole. It\nraided a power plant, so it energizes\nitself with electricity.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CELESTEELA
It appeared from the Ultra Wormhole.\nWitnesses observed it flying across the\nsky at high speed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_KARTANA
This Ultra Beast's body, which is as\nthin as paper, is like a sharpened\nsword.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GUZZLORD
An unknown life-form called a UB. It\nmay be constantly hungry-it is certainly\nalways devouring something.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NECROZMA
Light is the source of its energy. If\nit isn't devouring light, impurities\nbuild up in it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MAGEARNA
Its mechanized body is merely a vessel.\nIts true self is its Soul-Heart, an\nartificial soul.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MARSHADOW
It lurks in the shadows of others,\ncopying their movements and powers. It\nis craven and cowering.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_POIPOLE
This Ultra Beast is well enough liked\nto be chosen as a first partner in its\nown world.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NAGANADEL
It stores hundreds of liters of\npoisonous liquid in its body. It is one\nof the organisms known as UBs.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_STAKATAKA
When stone walls started moving and\nattacking, the brute's true identity was\nthis mysterious life-form.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BLACEPHALON
It causes explosions, then takes\nadvantage of opponents' surprise to rob\nthem of their vitality.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZERAORA
It approaches its enemies at the speed\nof lightning, then tears them limb from\nlimb with its sharp claws.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MELTAN
It melts particles of iron and other\nmetals found in the subsoil, so it can\nabsorb them into its molten steel body.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MELMETAL
Revered long ago for its capacity\nto create iron from nothing, it has\ncome back to life after 3000 years.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GROOKEY
It attacks with rapid beats of its\nstick. As it strikes with amazing speed,\nit gets more and more pumped.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_THWACKEY
The faster a Thwackey can beat out a\nrhythm with its two sticks, the more respect\nit wins from its peers.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RILLABOOM
By drumming, it taps into the power of\nits special tree stump. The roots of the\nstump follow its direction in battle.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SCORBUNNY
It has special pads on the backs of\nits feet, and one on its nose. Its\npads radiate tremendous heat.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RABOOT
Its thick and fluffy fur protects it\nfrom the cold and enables it to\nuse hotter fire moves.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CINDERACE
It gets pumped up when cheered on.\nBut if it starts showboating, it could put\nitself in a tough spot.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SOBBLE
When it gets wet, its skin changes\ncolor, and this POK\eMON becomes\ninvisible as if it were camouflaged.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DRIZZILE
Highly intelligent but also very lazy,\nit keeps enemies out of its territory\nby laying traps everywhere.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_INTELEON
It picks out foes' weak points so it\ncan precisely blast them with water\nthat shoots from its fingertips.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SKWOVET
This POK\eMON becomes uneasy if its\ncheeks are ever completely empty\nof berries.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GREEDENT
This POK\eMON has strong teeth and\ncan chew through the toughest of\nberry shells.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ROOKIDEE
It will bravely challenge any foe, no\nmatter how powerful. Even suffering\na defeat increases its strength a bit.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CORVISQUIRE
The lessons of many harsh battles\nhave taught it how to accurately judge\nan opponent's strength.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CORVIKNIGHT
The black luster of its steel body\ncould drive terror into the heart of\nany foe.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BLIPBUG
A constant collector of information,\nthis POK\eMON is very smart. Very\nstrong is what it isn't.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DOTTLER
As it grows inside its shell, it uses\nits psychic abilities to monitor its\nsurroundings and wait for evolution.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ORBEETLE
It's famous for its high intelligence,\nand the large size of its brain is proof\nthat it has immense psychic power.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NICKIT
Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it\nsilently raids the food stores of others.\nIt survives off its ill-gotten gains.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_THIEVUL
With a lithe body and sharp claws, it\ngoes around stealing food and eggs.\nIt secretly marks its future targets.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GOSSIFLEUR
It anchors itself in the ground and\nbasks in the sun. After absorbing\nenough sunlight, it blooms vividly.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ELDEGOSS
The seeds attached to its cotton fluff\nare full of nutrients. It spreads them on\nthe wind so that others can benefit.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WOOLOO
If its fleece grows too long, it won't\nbe able to move. Cloth made with\nits wool is surprisingly durable.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DUBWOOL
Its majestic horns are meant only to\nimpress the opposite gender. They\nnever see use in battle.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CHEWTLE
Apparently the itch of its teething\nimpels it to snap its jaws at anything\nin front of it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DREDNAW
With jaws that can shear through steel\nrods, this highly aggressive POK\eMON\nchomps down on its unfortunate prey.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_YAMPER
This greedy POK\eMON only helps people\nwith their work because it wants treats.\nAs it runs, it crackles with electricity.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BOLTUND
It sends electricity through its legs\nto boost their strength. Running at\ntop speed, it easily breaks 50 mph.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ROLYCOLY
It can race around like a unicycle,\neven on rough, rocky terrain. Burning\ncoal sustains it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CARKOL
By rapidly rolling its legs, it can\neasily travel at over 18 mph. It\nforms coal inside its body.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_COALOSSAL
While engaged in battle, its mountain\nof coal will burn bright red, scorching\nthe surrounding area with sparks.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_APPLIN
As soon as it's born, it burrows into\nan apple. the flavor of the apple is\nwhat determines its evolution.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FLAPPLE
It ate a sour apple, which induced its\nevolution. It stores an acid capable of\ncausing chemical burns in its cheeks.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_APPLETUN
It ate a sweet apple, which induced\nits evolution. Back in the day, children\nused to have it as a snack.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SILICOBRA
It spews sand from its nostrils. While\nthe enemy is blinded, it burrows into\nthe ground to hide.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SANDACONDA
When it contracts its body, over 220\npounds of sand sprays from its nose.\nIt becomes disheartened if it runs out.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CRAMORANT
This hungry POK\eMON swallows Arrokuda\nwhole. Occasionally, it makes a mistake\nand tries to swallow other POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARROKUDA
It becomes extremely sluggish after\neating its fill. That's when Cramorant\nswallows it up.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BARRASKEWDA
Its jaw that's as sharp as a spear and\nas strong as steel. It spins its tail fins\nto surge forward at over 100 knots.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TOXEL
It manipulates the chemical makeup of\nits poison to produce electricity. Despite\na weak voltage, it can cause paralysis.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TOXTRICITY
This short-tempered and aggressive\nPOK\eMON chugs stagnant water to\nabsorb any toxins it might contain.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SIZZLIPEDE
It stores flammable gas in its body\nand uses it to generate heat. It then\ncoils around its prey and cooks it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CENTISKORCH
This excessively hostile POK\eMON has\nlarge and very sharp fangs in addition\nto its dangerous burning body. 

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CLOBBOPUS
It's very curious, but its means of\ninvestigating things is to try to punch\nthem with its tentacles.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GRAPPLOCT
Searching for an opponent to test its\nskills against, it emerges onto land. Once\nthe battle is over, it returns to the sea.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SINISTEA
This POK\eMON is said to have been\nborn when a lonely spirit possessed\na cold, leftover cup of tea.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_POLTEAGEIST
This species lives in antique teapots.\nMost pots are forgeries, but on rare\noccasions, an authentic work is found.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_HATENNA
Via the protrusion on its head, it\nsenses other creatures' emotions.\nIt prefers areas without people.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_HATTREM
No matter who you are, if you bring\nstrong emotions near this POK\eMON,\nit will silence you violently.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_HATTERENE
Known as the Forest Witch, if you are\ntoo loud around it, you risk being torn\napart by the claws on its tentacle.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IMPIDIMP
It sneaks into people's homes, taking\nand feasting on the negative energy\nof the frustrated occupants.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MORGREM
With sly cunning, it lures people into\nthe woods. Some believe it to have\nthe power to make crops grow.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GRIMMSNARL
Its hairs work like muscle fibers.\nWhen its hairs unfurl, they latch on to\nfoes, ensnaring them like tentacles.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OBSTAGOON
It evolved after experiencing numerous\nfights. While crossing its arms, it lets out a\nshout that would make anyone flinch.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PERRSERKER
What appears to be an iron helmet is\nactually hardened hair. This POK\eMON\nlives for the thrill of battle.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CURSOLA
Be cautious of the ectoplasmic body\nsurrounding its soul. You'll become stiff\nas stone if you touch it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SIRFETCHD
After deflecting attacks with its hard\nleaf shield, it strikes back with its sharp\nleek stalk. 

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MR_RIME
Its amusing movements make it very\npopular. It releases its psychic power\nfrom the pattern on its belly.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RUNERIGUS
Never touch its shadowlike body, or\nyou'll be shown the horrific memories\nbehind the picture carved into it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MILCERY
They say that any patisserie visited\nby Milcery is guaranteed success and\ngood fortune.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ALCREMIE_STRAWBERRY
It evolved from a Milcery that held\nonto a Strawberry Sweet. Its flavor\ndepends on how it was mixed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FALINKS
The six of them work together as one.\nTeamwork is also their battle strategy, and\nthey constantly change their formation.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PINCURCHIN
It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth\nto scrape it off rocks. Electric current\nflows from the tips of its spines.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SNOM
It eats snow that piles up on the\nground. The more snow it eats, the\nbigger its spikes grow.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FROSMOTH
Icy scales fall from its wings\nlike snow as it flies over fields\nand mountains.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_STONJOURNER
Once a year, on a specific date and\nat a specific time, they gather out of\nnowhere and form up in a circle.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_EISCUE
It drifted in on the flow of ocean\nwaters from a frigid place. It keeps its\nhead iced constantly to stay cold.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_INDEEDEE
Through its horns, it can pick up on\nthe emotions of creatures around it. Males\nwill act as valets for those they serve.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MORPEKO
As it eats the seeds stored up in its\npouches, it generates electricity while\nsatisfying its constant hunger.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CUFANT
If a job requires serious strength,\nCufant will excel at it. Its copper body\ntarnishes in the rain, turning green.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_COPPERAJAH
These POK\eMON live in herds. Their\ntrunks have incredible grip strength,\nstrong enough to crush giant rocks.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DRACOZOLT
The powerful muscles in its tail\ngenerate its electricity. Its upper half\nis entirely too small. 

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARCTOZOLT
The shaking of its freezing upper half\nis what generates its electricity. It has\na hard time walking around.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DRACOVISH
Its mighty legs are capable of running\nat speeds exceeding 40 mph, but it can't\nbreathe unless it's underwater.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARCTOVISH
The skin on its face is impervious\nto attack, but breathing difficulties\nmade it go extinct anyway.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DURALUDON
Its body resembles polished metal,\nand it's both lightweight and strong.\nHowever, its body rusts easily.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DREEPY
After being reborn as a ghost, Dreepy\nwanders the areas it used to inhabit back\nwhen it was alive in prehistoric seas.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DRAKLOAK
It's capable of flying faster than 120\nmph. It battles alongside Dreepy and\ndotes on them until they evolve.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DRAGAPULT
Apparently the Dreepy inside its horns\neagerly look forward to being launched\nout at Mach speeds.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZACIAN
It  has slumbered for many years. Some\nsay it is Zamazenta's elder sister,\nothers say the two are rivals.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZAMAZENTA
It slept for aeons while in the form\nof a statue. It was asleep for so long,\npeople forgot that it ever existed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ETERNATUS
It was inside a meteorite that fell\n20,000 years ago. The energy that\nits core absorbs allows it to live.
 
#org @DEX_ENTRY_KUBFU
If it pulls the long white hair on\nits head, its fighting spirit heightens and\npower wells up from deep in its belly.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_URSHIFU_SINGLE
Inhabiting the mountains of a distant\nregion, it races across sheer cliffs, training\nits legs and refining its moves.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZARUDE
Once the vines on its body tear off,\nthey become nutrients in the soil. This helps\nthe plants of the forest grow.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_REGIELEKI
Its entire body is made of an organ\nthat generates electricity. It is capable of\ngenerating a region's worth of electricity.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_REGIDRAGO
Its body is composed of crystallized\ndragon energy. It is said to contain the\npower of every Dragon POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GLASTRIER
Glastrier has tremendous physical\nstrength. The mask covering its face is\n100 times stronger than diamond.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SPECTRIER
As it dashes through the night, it\nabsorbs the life energy of sleeping POK\eMON. It\ncraves silence and solitude.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CALYREX
Its every move is filled with grace\nand dignity. Extremely intelligent, it is said\nto see past, present, and future events.

//Special Form Entries

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RATTATA_A
When the sun goes down, it becomes\nactive. It runs around town on a chase\nfor good food for its boss-Raticate.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RATICATE_A
It makes its Rattata underlings gather\nfood for it, dining solely on the most\nnutritious and delicious fare.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RAICHU_A
It focuses psychic energy into its tail\nand rides it like it's surfing. Another\nname for this POK\eMON is "hodad."

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SANDSHREW_A
It lives on snowy mountains. Its steel\nshell is very hard-so much so, it can't\nroll its body up into a ball.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SANDSLASH_A
It runs across snow-covered plains at\nhigh speeds. It developed thick, sharp\nclaws to plow through the snow.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_VULPIX_A
In hot weather, this POK\eMON makes ice\nshards with its six tails and sprays\nthem around to cool itself off.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NINETALES_A
It lives on mountains perpetually\ncovered in snow and is revered as a\ndeity incarnate.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DIGLETT_A
Its golden hairs function as sensors.\nIt pokes them out of its burrow to\nmonitor its surroundings.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DUGTRIO_A
Its metallic whiskers are heavy, so\nit's not very fast, but it has the\npower to dig through bedrock.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MEOWTH_A
It's impulsive, selfish, and fickle.\nIt's very popular with Trainers who\nlike giving it the attention it needs.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MEOWTH_G
These daring POK\eMON have coins on\ntheir foreheads. Darker coins are harder,\nand harder coins garner more respect.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PERSIAN_A
It has the classiest coat. The rippling\nof its fur in the heat of battle has a\nbeauty all its own.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GEODUDE_A
Its body is a magnetic stone. Iron sand\nattaches firmly to the portions of its\nbody that are particularly magnetic.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GRAVELER_A
Graveler's entire body is tinged with\nelectricity due to the stones it likes\nto eat. It's very quick-tempered.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GOLEM_A
Since it can't fire boulders at a rapid\npace, it's been known to seize nearby\nGeodude and fire them from its back.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PONYTA_G
Its small horn hides a healing power.\nWith a few rubs from this its horn, any\nslight wound you have will be healed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RAPIDASH_G
Brave and prideful, it dashes airily\nthrough the forest, its steps aided by\npsychic powers stored in its fetlocks.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SLOWPOKE_G
Because it eats the seeds of a plant\nthat grows only in Galar, their tails have\ndeveloped a spicy flavor.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SLOWBRO_G
A Shellder bite set off a chemical\nreaction with the spices inside its body,\ncausing Slowbro to become a Poison-type.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FARFETCHD_G
It uses the stalks of leeks that are\nlarger and thicker than usual, which\nmade them to adapt to a unique form.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GRIMER_A
A Grimer, which had been brought in to\nsolve a problem with garbage, developed\nover time into this form.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MUK_A
The garbage it eats causes continuous\nchemical changes in its body, which\nproduce its vivid coloration.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_EXEGGUTOR_A
It swings its long neck like a whip and\nsmacks its opponents. This makes\nExeggutor itself dizzy, too.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MAROWAK_A
Its custom is to mourn its lost friends.\nMounds of dirt by the side of the road\nmark the graves of the Marowak.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WEEZING_G
This POK\eMON consumes particles that\ncontaminate the air. Instead of leaving\ndroppings, it expels clean air.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MR_MIME_G
It can radiate chilliness from the\nbottoms of its feet. It'll spend its\nday tap dancing on a frozen floor.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARTICUNO_G
Known as Articuno, this POK\eMON fires\nbeams that can immobilize opponents as\nif they had been frozen solid.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZAPDOS_G
One kick from its powerful legs will\npulverize a dump truck. It supposedly runs\nthrough the mountains at over 180 mph.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MOLTRES_G
Its sinister, flame-like aura consumes\nthe spirit of any creature it hits. Victims\nbecome burned-out shadows of themselves.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SLOWKING_G
While chanting strange spells, this\nPOK\eMON combines its internal toxins with what\nit's eaten, creating a strange potion.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CORSOLA_G
Sudden climate change wiped out this\nancient kind of Corsola. It absorbs the\nlife force of others through its branches.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZIGZAGOON_G
It moves in zigzags and wreaks havoc\nupon its surroundings. It is thought to\nbe the oldest form of Zigzagoon.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_LINOONE_G
It uses its long tongue to taunt foes.\nOnce the opposition is enraged, it\nhurls itself, tackling them forcefully.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DARUMAKA_G
They freeze their breath to make\nsnowballs, using them as ammo for\nplayful snowball fights.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DARMANITAN_G
Though it has a gentle disposition,\nit's also very strong. It stashes food\nin the snowball on its head.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DARMANITAN_G_ZEN
Anger has reignited its atrophied\nflame sac. This POK\eMON spews fire all\nover as it rampages indiscriminately.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_YAMASK_G
It's said that this POK\eMON was formed\nwhen an ancient clay tablet was drawn\nto a vengeful spirit.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_STUNFISK_G
Its conspicuous lips lure prey in as\nit lies in wait in the mud. When prey\ngets close, it will clamp down hard.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZYGARDE_10
Born when around 10% of Zygarde's cells\nhave been gathered from all over, this\nform is skilled in close-range combat.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZYGARDE_COMPLETE
This is Zygarde's 100% form.\nIt has enough power to overwhelm\neven Xerneas or Yveltal.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ORICORIO_Y
This Oricorio has sipped bright yellow\nnectar. Its bright, cheerful dance\nmelts the hearts of its enemies.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ORICORIO_P
This Oricorio has sipped pink nectar.\nIts enemies' hearts melt at the sight\nof its gently swaying hips.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ORICORIO_S
This Oricorio has sipped purple nectar.\nSome dancers use its graceful, elegant\ndancing as inspiration.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_LYCANROC_N
They live alone without forming packs.\nThey only listen to orders from those\nwho can draw out their true power.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_LYCANROC_DUSK
This strange form is the result of it\nevolving at dusk. An intense fighting\nspirit underlies its calmness.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WISHIWASHI_S
At their appearance, even Gyarados flee.\nWhen they team up to use Water Gun, its\npower exceeds that of Hydro Pump.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NECROZMA_DUSK_MANE
This is Necrozma while it's absorbing\nthe power of Solgaleo, making it very\nferocious and impossible to control.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NECROZMA_DAWN_WINGS
Lunala no longer has a will of its own.\nNow under the control of Necrozma, it\ncontinuously expels all of its energy.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NECROZMA_ULTRA
This is its form when it has absorbed\noverwhelming light energy. It fires\nlaser beams from all over its body.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CRAMORANT_GULPING
The slightest shock is sometimes\nenough to get this POK\eMON to spit\nout the Arrokuda lodged in its throat.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CRAMORANT_GORGING
This Cramorant has accidentally gotten\na Pikachu lodged in its gullet. While it\nseems to be choking, it isn't bothered.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TOXTRICITY_LOW_KEY
While generating electricity, it fills\nsurroundings with what sounds like\nthe strumming of a bass guitar.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SINISTEA_CHIPPED
The swirl pattern in its body is its\nweakness. If it gets stirred, the swirl\nloses its shape, and it gets dizzy.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_POLTEAGEIST_CHIPPED
When angered, it launches tea from\nits body at the offender's mouth. The\ntea causes strong chills if swallowed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ALCREMIE_BERRY
It evolved from a Milcery that held\nonto a Berry Sweet. The flavor of its\ncream depends on how it was mixed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ALCREMIE_CLOVER
It evolved from a Milcery that held\nonto a Clover Sweet. The flavor of its\ncream depends on how it was mixed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ALCREMIE_FLOWER
It evolved from a Milcery that held\nonto a Flower Sweet. The flavor of its\ncream depends on how it was mixed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ALCREMIE_LOVE
It evolved from a Milcery that held\nonto a Love Sweet. The flavor of its\ncream depends on how it was mixed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ALCREMIE_RIBBON
It evolved from a Milcery that held\nonto a Ribbon Sweet. The flavor of its\ncream depends on how it was mixed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ALCREMIE_STAR
It evolved from a Milcery that held\nonto a Star Sweet. The flavor of its\ncream depends on how it was mixed.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_EISCUE_NOICE
The ice covering this POK\eMON's face\nhas shattered, revealing a slightly worried\nexpression that many are enamored with.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_INDEEDEE_FEMALE
These intelligent POK\eMON touch\nhorns with each other to share information\nbetween them.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MORPEKO_HANGRY
Intense hunger drives it to extremes\nof violence. Until its hunger is appeased,\nit gets up to all manner of evil deeds.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZACIAN_CROWNED
Now armed with a weapon it used in\nancient times, this POK\eMON needs only\na single strike to fell any target.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZAMAZENTA_CROWNED
Now that it has equipped its shield,\nit can shrug off impressive blows,\neven from Dynamaxed foes.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ETERNATUS_ETERNAMAX
Infinite amounts of energy pour from\nthis POK\eMON's enlarged core, warping\nthe surrounding space-time.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_URSHIFU_RAPID
This form of Urshifu strongly believes\nin defeating foes by raining many blows down\non them. Its strikes flow like a river.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZARUDE_DADA
This Zarude left its pack to raise a\nhuman child. It would wrap the child with its\ncloth to calm the child's crying.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CALYREX_ICE_RIDER
It is said that it once moved a\nlarge forest,and all the POK\eMON living there,\nto a new location overnight.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CALYREX_SHADOW_RIDER
Legends say that by using its power\nto see all from the past and future, this POK\eMON\nsaved forest creatures from a meteor strike.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WYRDEER
The fur shed from its beard retains heat\nwell and is a highly useful material for\nwinter clothing.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_KLEAVOR
Parts of its body turned to stone when it\nevolved thanks to an extremely rare ore\nfound in volcanic areas.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_URSALUNA
It was HISUI's swampy terrain that gave\nURSALUNA its burly physique and newfound\ncapacity to manipulate peat at will.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BASCULEGION
It can jump with incredible power.\nParts of its body are tinged red\nby the rage of its fallen friends.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SNEASLER
Thanks to its virulent poison and daunting\nphysical prowess, no other species could\nhope to best it on the frozen highlands.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OVERQWIL
OVERQWIL's poisonous spikes-now thicker,\nlonger, and stronger-will automatically\nstrike toward anything that moves.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ENAMORUS
According to legend, this POK\eMON's\nlove gives rise to the budding of\nfresh life across HISUI.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SPRIGATITO
Its fluffy fur is similar in composition to\nplants. This POK\eMON frequently washes its\nface to keep it from drying out.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FLORAGATO
FLORAGATO deftly wields the vine hidden\nbeneath its long fur, slamming the hard\nflower bud against its opponents.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MEOWSCARADA
It uses the fur lining in its cape to\ncamouflage the stem of its flower, creating\nthe illusion that the flower is floating.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FUECOCO
It lies on warm rocks and uses the heat\nabsorbed by its square-shaped scales\nto create fire energy.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CROCALOR
The combination of CROCALOR's fire energy\nand overflowing vitality has caused an\negg-shaped fireball to appear on its head.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SKELEDIRGE
Rumor has it that the bird was born\nwhen the fireball on SKELEDIRGE's\nhead gained a soul.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_QUAXLY
QUAXLY migrated to PALDEA from distant\nlands long ago. The gel secreted by its\nfeathers repels water and grime.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_QUAXWELL
QUAXWELL observes POK\eMON from various\nregions and incorporates their movements\ninto its own dance routines.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_QUAQUAVAL
This POK\eMON uses its powerful legs\nto perform striking dances from\nfar-off lands.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_LECHONK
This POK\eMON spurns all but the finest\nof foods. Its body gives off an herblike\nscent that BUG POK\eMON detest.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OINKOLOGNE
OINKOLOGNE is proud of its fine,\nglossy skin. It emits a concentrated\nscent from the tip of its tail.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TAROUNTULA
The ball of threads wrapped around its\nbody is elastic enough to deflect scythes\nof SCYTHER, this POK\eMON's natural enemy.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SPIDOPS
SPIDOPS covers its territory\nin tough, sticky threads to set up\ntraps for intruders.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NYMBLE
It has its third set of legs folded up. When\nit's in a tough spot, this POK\eMON jumps\nover 30 feet using the strength of its legs.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_LOKIX
When it decides to fight all out, it\nstands on its previously folded legs\nto enter SHOWDOWN MODE.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PAWMI
Electric sacs on its cheeks can produce\nelectricity only if PAWMI rubs them\nfuriously with the pads on its forepaws.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PAWMO
When its group is attacked, PAWMO is\nthe first to leap into battle,\ndefeating enemies with electric shocks.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PAWMOT
PAWMOT's fluffy fur acts as a\nbattery. It can store the same amount\nof electricity as an electric car.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TANDEMAUS
The pair sticks together no matter what.\nThey split any food they find exactly\nin half and then eat it together.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MAUSHOLD
The two little ones just appeared one\nday. The group might be a family of related\nPOK\eMON, but nobody knows for sure.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FIDOUGH
The yeast in FIDOUGH's breath is useful\nfor cooking, so this POK\eMON has been\nprotected by people since long ago.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DACHSBUN
The surface of this POK\eMON's skin\nhardens when exposed to intense heat,\nand its body has an appetizing aroma.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SMOLIV
This POK\eMON converts nutrients\ninto oil, which it stores in the\nfruit on its head.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DOLLIV
DOLLIV shares its tasty, fresh-scented\noil with others. This species has coexisted\nwith humans since times long gone.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARBOLIVA
This POK\eMON drives back enemies by\nlaunching its rich, aromatic oil at\nthem with enough force to smash a boulder.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SQUAWKABILLY
These POK\eMON prefer to live in cities.\nThey form flocks based on the color of\ntheir feathers, and fight over territory.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NACLI
As it treads along the ground, grains of\nrock salt are left behind. These trails\nhave been called "salt roads" since ages.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_NACLSTACK
This POK\eMON dry cures its prey by spraying\nsalt over them. The curing process\nsteals away the water in the prey's body.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GARGANACL
Rock salt obtained from GARGANACL has\nmany restorative elements and is\nhelpful for maintaining one's health.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CHARCADET
Its firepower increases when it fights,\nreaching over 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit.\nIt likes BERRIES that are rich in fat.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARMAROUGE
This POK\eMON clads itself in armor that\nhas been fortified by psychic and fire\nenergy, and it shoots blazing fireballs.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CERULEDGE
Should anyone dare to show its trainer\nhostility, CERULEDGE will cut the\noffender down without a second thought.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TADBULB
TADBULB shakes its tail to generate\nelectricity. If it senses danger, it will make\nits head blink on and off to alert its allies.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BELLIBOLT
What appear to be eyes are actually organs\nfor discharging the electricity generated by\nBELLIBOLT's belly-button dynamo.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WATTREL
These POK\eMON make their nests on coastal\ncliffs. The nests have a strange, crackling\ntexture, and they're a popular delicacy.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_KILOWATTREL
KILOWATTREL inflates its throat sac to\namplify its electricity. By riding the\nwind, this POK\eMON can fly 430 miles a day.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MASCHIFF
Its well-developed jaw and fangs\nare strong enough to crunch\nthrough boulders.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MABOSSTIFF
MABOSSTIFF loves playing with children.\nThough usually gentle, it takes on an\nintimidating look when protecting its family.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SHROODLE
To keep enemies away from its territory,\nit paints markings around its nest using\na poisonous liquid that has an acrid odor.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GRAFAIAI
Each GRAFAIAI paints its own individual\npattern, and it will paint that same pattern\nover and over again throughout its life.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BRAMBLIN
Not even BRAMBLIN knows where it's headed\nas it tumbles across the wilderness, blown\nby the wind. It loathes getting wet.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BRAMBLEGHAST
BRAMBLEGHAST wanders around arid regions.\nOn rare occasions, mass outbreaks of\nthese POK\eMON will bury an entire town.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TOEDSCOOL
TOEDSCOOL lives in muggy forests.\nThe flaps that fall from its body\nare chewy and very delicious.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TOEDSCRUEL
TOEDSCRUELS gather into groups and\nform colonies deep within forests.\nThey absolutely hate strangers approaching.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_KLAWF
This POK\eMON lives on sheer cliffs.\nIt sidesteps opponents' attacks, then\nlunges for their weak spots with its claws.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CAPSAKID
PALDEAN dishes can be extremely spicy\nbecause they include the shed front\nteeth of CAPSAKID among their ingredients.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SCOVILLAIN
The red head converts spicy chemicals into\nfire energy and blasts the surrounding\narea with a super spicy stream of flame.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RELLOR
It rolls its mud ball around while the\nenergy it needs for evolution matures.\nEventually the time comes for it to evolve.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RABSCA
An infant sleeps inside the ball. RABSCA\nrolls the ball soothingly with its legs\nto ensure the infant sleeps comfortably.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FLITTLE
It spends its time running around wastelands.\nIf anyone steals its beloved berries, it\nwill chase them down and exact its revenge.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ESPATHRA
It emits psychic power from the gaps\nbetween its multicolored frills and\nsprints at speeds greater than 120 mph.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TINKATINK
It swings its handmade hammer around\nto protect itself, but the hammer is\noften stolen by POK\eMON that eat metal.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TINKATUFF
They sometimes come to human settlements,\nwhere they rummage through factories and\nwarehouses to gather metal.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TINKATON
A TINKATON leader teaches the\nTINKATINK in its group the skills\nneeded for pounding and shaping metal.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WIGLETT
This POK\eMON can pick up the scent\nof a VELUZA just over 65 feet away\nand will hide itself in the sand.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WUGTRIO
A variety of fish POK\eMON,\nWUGTRIO was once considered\nto be a regional form of DUGTRIO.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BOMBIRDIER
BOMBIRDIER uses the apron on its\nchest to bundle up food. It enjoys\ndropping things that make loud noises.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FINIZEN
Its water ring is made from seawater\nmixed with a sticky fluid that FINIZEN\nsecretes from its blowhole.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PALAFIN
Its physical capabilities are no different\nthan a FINIZEN's, but when its allies are\nin danger, it transforms and powers up.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_VAROOM
The steel section is VAROOM's actual\nbody. This POK\eMON converts the minerals\nof rocks into energy to fuel its activities.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_REVAVROOM
REVAVROOM viciously threatens others with\nthe sound of its exhaust. It sprays toxic\nfluids from its cylindrical mouth.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CYCLIZAR
It can sprint at over 70 mph while carrying\na human. The rider's body warms CYCLIZAR's\nback and lifts the POK\eMON's spirit.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ORTHWORM
This POK\eMON lives in arid deserts.\nIt maintains its metal body by\nconsuming iron from the soil.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GLIMMET
It absorbs nutrients from cave\nwalls. The petals it wears are\nmade of crystallized poison.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GLIMMORA
When this POK\eMON detects danger,\nit will open up its crystalline petals\nand fire beams from its conical body.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GREAVARD
This friendly POK\eMON doesn't like being\nalone. Pay it even the slightest bit of\nattention, and it will follow you forever.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_HOUNDSTONE
A lovingly mourned POK\eMON was reborn\nas HOUNDSTONE. It doesn't like anyone\ntouching the protuberance atop its head.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FLAMIGO
FLAMIGO apparently ties the base of its\nneck into a knot so that energy stored\nin its belly does not escape from its beak.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CETODDLE
It lives in frigid regions in pods\nof five or so individuals. It loves\nthe minerals found in snow and ice.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CETITAN
CETITANS wander around snowy, icy areas.\nIt protects its body with powerful muscles\nand a thick layer of fat under its skin.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_VELUZA
VELUZA has superb regenerative capabilities.\nIt sheds spare flesh from its body to\nboost its agility, then charges at its prey.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DONDOZO
It treats TATSUGIRI like its boss and\nfollows it loyally. Though powerful,\nDONDOZO is apparently not very smart.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TATSUGIRI
This is a small dragon POK\eMON. It lives\ninside the mouth of DONDOZO to protect\nitself from enemies on the outside.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ANNIHILAPE
PRIMEAPE evolved into ANNIHILAPE after\nrepeatedly using a move with enough force\nto burst the blood vessels in its head.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CLODSIRE
It lives at the bottom of swamps. It will\ncarry Wooper on its back and ferry them\nacross water from one shore to the other.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FARIGIRAF
The hardened head from the tail protects\nthe head of the main body as FARIGIRAF\nwhips its long neck to headbutt enemies.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DUDUNSPARCE
It drives enemies out of its nest by sucking\nin enough air to fill its long lungs, then\nreleasing the air in an intense blast.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_KINGAMBIT
Only a BISHARP that stands above\nall others in its vast army can\nevolve into KINGAMBIT.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GREAT_TUSK
This creature resembles a mysterious\nPOK\eMON that, according to a paranormal\nmagazine, has lived since ancient times.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SCREAM_TAIL
It resembles a mysterious POK\eMON\ndescribed in a paranormal magazine as a\nJIGGLYPUFF from one billion years ago.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BRUTE_BONNET
It is possible that the creature listed\nas BRUTE BONNET in a certain book could\nactually be this POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FLUTTER_MANE
This POK\eMON has characteristics\nsimilar to those of FLUTTER MANE,\na creature mentioned in a certain book.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SLITHER_WING
This mysterious POK\eMON has some\nsimilarities to a creature that an\nold book introduced as SLITHER WING.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SANDY_SHOCKS
It slightly resembles a MAGNETON that\nlived for 10,000 years and was featured\nin an article in a paranormal magazine.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_TREADS
This POK\eMON closely resembles a scientific\nweapon that a paranormal magazine claimed\nwas sent to this planet by aliens.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_BUNDLE
It resembles a mysterious object mentioned\nin an old book. There are only two reported\nsightings of this POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_HANDS
This POK\eMON shares many similarities\nwith IRON HANDS, an object mentioned\nin a certain expedition journal.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_JUGULIS
It's possible that IRON JUGULIS,\nan object described in an old book,\nmay actually be this POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_MOTH
This POK\eMON resembles an unknown object\ndescribed in a paranormal magazine as\na UFO sent to observe humanity.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_THORNS
Some of its notable features match\nthose of an object named within a\ncertain expedition journal as IRON THORNS.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FRIGIBAX
FRIGIBAX's dorsal fin can convert\nheat from fiery moves into ICE-type\nenergy to freeze the air.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARCTIBAX
ARCTIBAX freezes the air around it,\nprotecting its face with an ice mask\nand turning its dorsal fin into a blade.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BAXCALIBUR
This POK\eMON blasts cryogenic air\nout from its mouth. This air can\ninstantly freeze even liquid-hot lava.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GIMMIGHOUL
It lives inside an old treasure chest.\nSometimes it gets left in shop corners\nsince no one realizes it's actually a POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GHOLDENGO
This POK\eMON likes lively\nplaces. Some wild GHOLDENGO\neven live in cities.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WO_CHIEN
It drains the life-force from vegetation,\ncausing nearby forests to instantly\nwither and fields to turn barren.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CHIEN_PAO
The hatred of those who perished\nby the sword long ago has clad\nitself in snow and become a POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TING_LU
The fear poured into an ancient ritual\nvessel has clad itself in rocks and\ndirt to become a POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_CHI_YU
The envy accumulated within curved beads\nthat sparked multiple conflicts has clad\nitself in fire and become a POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ROARING_MOON
It is possible that this is the creature\nlisted as ROARING MOON in an expedition\njournal that still holds many mysteries.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_VALIANT
It has some similarities to a\nmad scientist's invention covered\nin a paranormal magazine.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_KORAIDON
It has similar characteristics\nto a creature described in an\nold book as the WINGED KING.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MIRAIDON
Its characteristics match those of a\nmysterious object recorded in an old\nexpedition journal as the IRON SERPENT.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WALKING_WAKE
It resembles an illustration published\nin a paranormal magazine, said to be\na depiction of a super-ancient SUICUNE.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_LEAVES
According to the few eyewitness accounts\nthat exist, it used its shining blades\nto julienne large trees and boulders.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DIPPLIN
DIPPLIN is two creatures in one POK\eMON.\nIts evolution was triggered by a special\napple grown only in one place.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_POLTCHAGEIST
POLTCHAGEIST looks like a regional form of\nSINISTEA, but it was recently discovered\nthat the two POK\eMON are entirely unrelated.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SINISTCHA
It pretends to be tea, trying to fool people\ninto drinking it so it can drain their life\nforce. Its ruse is generally unsuccessful.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OKIDOGI
OKIDOGI is a ruffian with a short temper.\nIt can pulverize anything by swinging\naround the chain on its neck.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MUNKIDORI
MUNKIDORI keeps itself somewhere safe\nwhile it toys with its foes, using\npsychokinesis to induce intense dizziness.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_FEZANDIPITI
FEZANDIPITI beats its glossy wings\nto scatter pheromones that captivate\npeople and POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OGERPON
This mischief-loving POK\eMON is full of\ncuriosity. It battles by drawing out the\ntype-based energy stored within its masks.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARCHALUDON
It digs holes on mountains, searching\nfor food. It's so durable that being\ncaught in a cave-in won't faze it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_HYDRAPPLE
Seven syrpents live inside an\napple made of syrup. The syrpent\nin the center is the commander.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GOUGING_FIRE
There are scant few reports of this creature\nbeing sighted. One short video shows it\nrampaging and spouting pillars of flame.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_RAGING_BOLT
It's said to incinerate everything around\nit with lightning launched from its fur.\nVery little is known about this creature.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_BOULDER
It was named after a mysterious\nobject recorded in an old book.\nIts body seems to be metallic.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_IRON_CROWN
It resembles a mysterious object introduced\nin a paranormal magazine as a cutting-edge\nweapon shaped like a COBALION.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TERAPAGOS
It's thought that this POK\eMON lived\nin ancient PALDEA until it got caught\nin seismic shifts and went extinct.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_PECHARUNT
Its peach-shaped shell serves as storage\nfor poison. It makes poisonous mochi\nand serves them to people and POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GROWLITHE_H
The igneous rock components in the fur\nof this species are the result of\nvolcanic activity in its habitat.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ARCANINE_H
Its magnificent bark conveys a sense\nof majesty. Anyone hearing it can't\nhelp but grovel before it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_VOLTORB_H
When excited, it discharges the electric\ncurrent it has stored in its belly,\nthen lets out a great, uproarious laugh.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ELECTRODE_H
The tissue on the surface of its body\nis curiously similar in composition\nto an APRICORN. 

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TYPHLOSION_H
Said to purify lost, forsaken souls\nwith its flames and guide them\nto the afterlife.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_QWILFISH_H
It absorbs toxins from the food it eats.\nThe distinct purple spikes on its body\nare evidence of its potent poison.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SNEASEL_H
Its sturdy, curved claws are ideal\nfor traversing precipitous cliffs. 

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SAMUROTT_H
Hard of heart and deft of blade, this rare\nform of SAMUROTT is a product of the\nPOK\eMON's evolution in the region of HISUI.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_LILLIGANT_H
Its well-developed legs are the\nresult of a life spent on mountains\ncovered in deep snow.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZORUA_H
Derives power from resentment, which\nrises as energy atop its head and\ntakes on the forms of foes.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ZOROARK_H
Heedless of its own safety, ZOROARK attacks\nits nemeses with a bitter energy so intense,\nit lacerates ZOROARK's own body.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BRAVIARY_H
It blasts lakes with shock waves,\nthen scoops up any prey that float\nto the water's surface.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SLIGGOO_H
The iron in SLIGGOO's drinking water\nturned its shell metallic. The POK\eMON doesn't\ncome out of its shell on sunny days.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GOODRA_H
Able to freely control the hardness\nof its metallic shell. It loathes\nsolitude and is extremely clingy.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_AVALUGG_H
With its icy jaw, it swiftly plows across\nsnowy fields and mountains, in search of\nvegetables people have stored in the snow.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DECIDUEYE_H
The air stored inside the rachises\nof DECIDUEYE's feathers insulates the\nPOK\eMON against HISUI's extreme cold.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BASCULIN_WHITE
They live in frigid seas, forming schools\nand sharing food. When the time comes, they\nreturn to the river they were born in.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_BASCULEGION_F
The souls of its comrades cloak its\nbody and propel it effortlessly\nthrough even raging rapids.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_ENAMORUS_THERIAN
From the clouds, it descends upon those who\ntreat any form of life with disrespect and\nmetes out wrathful, ruthless punishment.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TAUROS_P_COMBAT
This kind of TAUROS, known as the COMBAT\nBREED, is distinguished by its thick,\npowerful muscles and its fierce disposition.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TAUROS_P_BLAZE
People call this kind of TAUROS the BLAZE\nBREED due to the hot air it snorts from\nits nostrils. Its three tails are intertwined.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TAUROS_P_AQUA
This POK\eMON blasts water from holes on\nthe tips of its horns-the high-pressure\njets pierce right through TAUROS's foes.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_WOOPER_P
It's dangerous for WOOPER to travel alone.\nThey line up in groups of three and help\neach other as they walk around the wetlands.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_URSALUNA_BLOODMOON
This special URSALUNA can see in the dark\nwith its left eye and protects itself\nwith mud that is as hard as iron.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OINKOLOGNE_F
Well-developed muscles in its legs\nallow it to leap more than 16 feet\nwith no trouble at all.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_MAUSHOLD_THREE
They build huge nests with many\nrooms that are used for different\npurposes, such as eating and sleeping.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SQUAWKABILLY_BLUE
SQUAWKABILLY with blue plumage are the\nsecond most populous variety after their\ngreen counterparts, which they view as foes.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SQUAWKABILLY_YELLOW
The yellow SQUAWKABILLY are especially\nfierce. They've even been known to drive\nother bird POK\eMON out of town.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SQUAWKABILLY_WHITE
This POK\eMON dislikes being alone.\nIt has a strong sense of community and\nsurvives by cooperating with allies.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TATSUGIRI_DROOPY
This POK\eMON tricks its opponents\nby playing dead. It is small and weak,\nbut it uses its smarts to survive.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_TATSUGIRI_STRETCHY
It's one of the most intelligent\ndragon POK\eMON. It camouflages\nitself by inflating its throat sac.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_DUDUNSPARCE_THREE_SEGMENT
The gentle DUDUNSPARCE will put Pokémon\nthat wander into its nest onto its back\nand carry them to the entrance.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_GIMMIGHOUL_ROAMING
It wanders around, carrying an old coin\non its back. It survives by draining the life\nforce from humans who try to pick it up.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_POLTCHAGEIST_ARTISAN
It sprinkles some of its powdery body\nonto food and drains the life-force\nfrom those who so much as lick it.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_SINISTCHA_MASTERPIECE
It lives inside a superb teacup that was\ncrafted by a potter of great renown.\nCollectors positively adore this POK\eMON.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OGERPON_WELLSPRING
This form excels in both attack and\ndefense. It ceaselessly unleashes\nmoves like a spring gushes water.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OGERPON_HEARTHFLAME
This form is the most aggressive,\nbombarding enemies with the intensity\nof flames blazing within a hearth.

#org @DEX_ENTRY_OGERPON_CORNERSTONE
This form has excellent defenses,\nabsorbing impacts solidly like the\ncornerstones that support houses.

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_HOOPA_UNBOUND
DJINN

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_CALYREX_ICE_RIDER
#org @DEX_CATEGORY_CALYREX_SHADOW_RIDER
HIGH KING

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_PONYTA_G
#org @DEX_CATEGORY_RAPIDASH_G
UNIQUE HORN

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_MR_MIME_G
DANCING

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_SLOWKING_G
HEXPERT

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_ARTICUNO_G
CRUEL

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_ZAPDOS_G
STRONG LEGS

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_MOLTRES_G
MALEVOLENT

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_DARMANITAN_G
ZEN CHARM

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_GROWLITHE_H
SCOUT

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_VOLTORB_H
#org @DEX_CATEGORY_ELECTRODE_H
SPHERE

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_TYPHLOSION_H
GHOST FLAME

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_LILLIGANT_H
SPINNING

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_BASCULIN_WHITE
MELLOW

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_ZORUA_H
SPITEFULFOX

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_ZOROARK_H
BANEFUL FOX

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_BRAVIARY_H
BATTLE CRY

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_SLIGGOO_H
SNAIL

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_GOODRA_H
SHELLBUNKER

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_PALAFIN_HERO
HERO

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_GIMMIGHOUL_ROAMING
COIN

#org @DEX_CATEGORY_WOOPER_P
POISON FISH